sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Server

    loop Retry (max 3)
        Client->>Server: GET /resource
        alt Success
            Server-->>Client: 200 OK
        else Rate Limited
            Server-->>Client: 429 Too Many Requests
        else Server Error
            Server-->>Client: 500 Internal Error
        end
    end

    Note over Client,Server: Connection closed
